'''Elisa Baldo''' ([[Camposampiero]], 26 December 1986) is an Italian archer who competes in [[compound bow]] archery.

== Biography ==
Baldo began competing at the regional level in 2008, and in 2018 she won her first Italian 3D Championship, organized by FITARCO in Lago Laceno (AV). She won again in 2021. She also participated in the Italian Field Archery Championships, where she won a gold medal in 2022 and a silver medal the following year.<ref>{{Cite web |title=fitarco-situazione-Elisa-Baldo |url=https://www.fitarco-italia.org/arcieri/situazione.php?Codice=73023|language=italian|website=fitarco.it}}</ref>

In the [[2022 World Archery 3D Championships]] in [[Terni]] she won a gold medal in the individual event, while in 2024 in [[Mokrice Castle|Mokrice]] she won a bronze.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Borgoricco. La campionessa di tiro con l'arco Elisa Baldo proclamata atleta dell'anno |url=https://www.ilgazzettino.it/nordest/padova/atleta_elisa_baldo_tiro_arco_campionessa_chi_e-7747250.html|language=italian|author=Luca Marin|website=ilgazzettino.it}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=mondiale-3d-2022-l-italia-domina-il-medagliere-con-14-podi |url=https://www.fitarco.it/media-fitarco/news/20-nazionali/9958-mondiale-3d-l-italia-domina-il-medagliere-con-14-podi.html|language=italian|website=fitarco.it}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=mondiali-3d-2024,-italia-perfetta-prima-nel-medagliere-con-13-podi |url=https://www.fitarco.it/media-fitarco/news/34-internazionale/10881-mondiali-3d,-italia-perfetta-prima-nel-medagliere-con-13-podi.html|language=italian|website=fitarco.it}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Mokrice 2024 World Archery 3D Championships |url=https://ianseo.net/Details.php?toId=19624|language=english|website=ianseo.net}}</ref>

In 2025 she participated in the [[2025 European Archery 3D Championships|European Archery 3D Championships]] in [[Divčibare]], Serbia, where she won bronze in the individual Compound Bow category.<ref>{{cite web|title=Fitarco Piemonte: Campionati Europei 3D, vittorie sulla neve|url=https://www.tuttosport.com/news/piemonte-news/2025/10/05-143635742/fitarco_piemonte_campionati_europei_3d_vittorie_sulla_neve|language=italian|website=tuttosport.com}}</ref>
<ref>{{cite web|title=Europei 3D: Italia prima nel medagliere grazie a 7 podi individuali|url=https://www.fitarco.it/media-fitarco/news/34-internazionale/11402-europei-3d-due-finali-per-l-oro-e-cinque-bronzi-per-gli-azzurri.html|language=italian|website=fitarco.it}}</ref>
