'''Luis Bacca Gonçalves''' (born 28 January 1998) is a Brazilian [[bobsleigh|bobsledder]]. He competed at the [[2026 Winter Olympics]] in [[Bobsleigh at the 2026 Winter Olympics – Two-man|two-man bobsleigh]], together with [[Edson Bindilatti]], finishing in 24th place. In the [[Bobsleigh at the 2026 Winter Olympics – Four-man|four-man bobsleigh]], together with Edson Bindilatti, [[Rafael Souza da Silva]] and [[Davidson Henrique de Souza]], he finished in 19th place,<ref>{{Cite web |title=Luis BACCA GONCALVES |url=https://www.olympics.com/en/milano-cortina-2026/results/athlete-details/23968 |work=[[Milano Cortina 2026 Olympics]] |access-date=23 February 2026 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260221192708/https://www.olympics.com/en/milano-cortina-2026/results/athlete-details/23968 |archive-date=21 February 2026 |url-status=dead}}</ref> the best result ever achieved by Brazil in [[Bobsleigh at the Winter Olympics]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Bobsled Brasil: 19º lugar é recorde histórico em Olimpíadas |trans-title=Bobsled Brazil: 19th place is a historic record in the Olympics |url=https://ge.globo.com/olimpiadas-de-inverno/noticia/2026/02/22/brasil-fica-em-19o-no-bobsled-4-man-e-tem-melhor-resultado-em-olimpiadas-de-inverno.ghtml |website=ge.globo.com |language=pt-BR |date=22 February 2026 |access-date=23 February 2026}}</ref>

