'''Yenifer Noelia Paredes Navarro''' (born 5 December 1995) is a Peruvian politician serving as a member of the [[Chamber of Deputies (Peru)|Chamber of Deputies]] since 2026.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.expreso.com.pe/politica/quien-es-yenifer-paredes-el-historial-de-la-nueva-diputada-que-juro-por-cajamarca-y-pedro-castillo-jpp-mp-noticia/1303904/|title=¿Quién es Yenifer Paredes? El historial de la nueva diputada que juró por Cajamarca y Pedro Castillo|work=[[Expreso]]|date=25 July 2026|language=es}}</ref> She is the sister of [[Lilia Paredes]] and the sister-in-law of [[Pedro Castillo]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.bbc.com/mundo/noticias-america-latina-62513311|title=Quién es Yenifer Paredes, la cuñada de Pedro Castillo contra la que dictaron 30 meses de prisión preventiva por presuntos delitos de lavado de dinero y organización criminal en Perú|publisher=[[BBC News]]|date=11 August 2022|language=es}}</ref>

